---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import LocationGrid from '../../components/LocationGrid.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Locations — H/HAUS"
  description="Explore the seven cities in the H/HAUS hacker-house network."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="kicker">The network</p>
    <h1>Pick a city.<br /><em>Meet your people.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Every H/HAUS chapter has its own local texture and shares the same simple premise: focused people do better work around other focused people.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="all-locations">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--compact">
      <p class="kicker">01—07</p>
      <h2 id="all-locations">The chapters</h2>
      <p>Medellín is the founding chapter. The wider network is forming city by city; details will be published only when they are real.</p>
    </div>
    <LocationGrid />
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
